OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies in M27 crash as
OL,4,Aroad remains shut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died following a
OL,7,Fcrash on the M27 with a stretch of the
OL,8,Fmotorway remaining closed eastbound.
OL,10,FHampshire police said the crash
OL,11,Finvolving a white Triumph motorcycle
OL,12,Fhappened shortly before 06:40 BST. The
OL,13,Fmotorcyclist, a man in his 60s, died at
OL,14,Fthe scene.
OL,16,FThe closure is in place between
OL,17,FWhiteley at junction 9 and junction 12
OL,18,Ffor Portsmouth. It was initially closed
OL,19,Ffrom junction 11 at Fareham. The
OL,20,Fwestbound carriageway remains open.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
