OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies in M27 crash as
OL,4,Aroad remains shut
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being diverted off at
OL,7,Fjunction 9 and on to the A27 towards
OL,8,FFareham. People are being urged to
OL,9,Fallow extra time for their journey,
OL,10,Fre-route or even delay their trip.
